# BlockNote (fibbelous client)

Packages live at repo-root `node_modules/@blocknote/{core,react,ariakit}` (hoisted), not under `client/node_modules`. Version pin: `package.json` `^0.51.x`.

## Custom inline content

Created via `createReactInlineContentSpec` (`@blocknote/react`).

For `content: "none"` (our `pageLink`):

- TipTap node is `atom: true`
- `selectable: false` (only `"styled"` content is selectable)
- Rendered with `ReactNodeViewRenderer` + wrapper `data-inline-content-type="<type>"`

Key impl: `node_modules/@blocknote/react/src/schema/ReactInlineContentSpec.tsx`

## Where our editor code lives

- Schema / specs: `src/lib/pageEditorSchema.ts`, `src/lib/pageLinkInline.tsx`
- Editor host + `links.onClick` for normal/legacy links: `src/components/page/PageBodyEditor.tsx`
- Link helpers / HTML round-trip: `src/lib/pageLinks.ts`
- Navigation from DOM renders: `src/lib/pageNavigate.ts`
